# pnpm only

Install, add, and update dependencies with pnpm. Do not run npm or yarn.

`pnpm-lock.yaml` is the lockfile. After any `package.json` change, run `pnpm install` and commit `pnpm-lock.yaml` with it. Do not create or update `package-lock.json`.

The deploy installs with `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`. A package added only to `package.json` or `package-lock.json` fails that install.
